    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Clinique Vétérinaire Vetriviera, located in the Castelli shopping complex at 448 boulevard du Mercantour in Nice, is a well-established practice on the French Riviera, with a medical team covering several specialties (medical imaging, orthopaedic surgery, dermatology, ophthalmology...). A reassuring address if you're travelling with your dog in the Nice area.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>According to the clinic's website (which now presents itself under the name Vet Riviera), it is open 24/7 and offers emergency care around the clock. The number is 04 93 71 21 41, for both appointments and emergencies. Calling before you come lets them expect you.</p>
      <div class="callout"><svg><use href="#i-check"/></svg> Emergencies: clinic open 24/7 (clinic website). Call 04 93 71 21 41 before you come.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The clinic is in the Ariane district, in the north-east of Nice, not far from the motorway and the main roads crossing the city.</p>
